## SCOPE CONTRACT 2: VFS DATA INTEGRITY & FRONTEND CONSUMPTION (CRITICAL)
**Priority:** P0  
**Owner:** [TBD]  
**Estimated Duration:** 4 days  
**Dependencies:** None

### Current State
- Build script has validation (lines 129-171) that checks for missing IDs
- `catalogue-index.json` was generated 2026-03-27 with validation passing
- VFS functions exist (`getProductsByVfsKeys.ts`) but NOT used in live queries
- Frontend still using legacy category queries

### Target State
- VFS is single source of truth for all catalogue navigation
- Frontend consumes VFS for: category pages, breadcrumbs, navigation
- All product queries use `catalogueLocationKeys` from VFS
- Validation runs on every build, fails build on data inconsistency

### Scope Contract
**IN SCOPE:**
- Audit and confirm VFS build script validation is working
- Replace legacy category queries with VFS-based queries
- Update `products/[...category]/page.tsx` to use VFS keys
- Update navigation components to use VFS metadata
- Implement breadcrumb generation from VFS breadcrumbs field
- Add runtime VFS validation (fail fast on inconsistency)
- Add integration tests for VFS consumption

**OUT OF SCOPE:**
- VFS schema changes (structure is correct)
- Migration from old category system (already done)
- Real-time VFS updates (rebuild is acceptable)

### Definition of Done
**LAYER 1 - CODE COMPLETE:**
- [ ] `getProductsByCategoryPath.ts` uses VFS keys instead of string matching
- [ ] Category page component uses VFS for breadcrumb generation
- [ ] Navigation uses VFS `slotMetadataMap` for URLs
- [ ] Runtime validation: throw on missing VFS metadata
- [ ] Remove all legacy `categoryPath` references from queries

**LAYER 2 - TESTING COMPLETE:**
- [ ] Unit test: `unrollDescendantKeys()` returns valid keys only
- [ ] Unit test: `buildGroqKeysParam()` generates valid GROQ
- [ ] Integration test: Category page loads products via VFS keys
- [ ] Integration test: Breadcrumbs render correctly from VFS
- [ ] Build test: Invalid data fails build (validation works)

**LAYER 3 - VERIFICATION COMPLETE:**
- [ ] Manual test: Navigate to `/shop/open-back` - products load
- [ ] Manual test: Breadcrumbs show correct hierarchy
- [ ] Manual test: Navigation links use correct VFS URLs
- [ ] Manual test: Empty category shows appropriate message
- [ ] Build test: Corrupt `catalogue-index.json` fails build

**LAYER 4 - DOCUMENTATION COMPLETE:**
- [ ] VFS consumption pattern documented
- [ ] Migration guide from legacy queries documented
- [ ] Troubleshooting guide for VFS issues

### Verification Methods
```bash
# Automated verification
npm run test:vfs:unit
npm run test:vfs:integration
npm run build  # Must pass VFS validation

# Manual verification checklist
# [ ] /shop/open-back loads products
# [ ] /shop/closed-back loads products
# [ ] Breadcrumbs show on category pages
# [ ] Navigation works from catalogue menu
# [ ] Build fails if catalogue-index.json is corrupted
```

