## SCOPE CONTRACT 3: BUILD-TIME TYPE SAFETY (HIGH)
**Priority:** P1  
**Owner:** [TBD]  
**Estimated Duration:** 2 days  
**Dependencies:** None

### Current State
- `next.config.ts` has `typescript: { ignoreBuildErrors: true }` - LINE 6
- `next.config.ts` has `eslint: { ignoreDuringBuilds: true }` - LINE 7
- Type errors deploy to production
- 42 instances of `any`, `unknown` type safety violations

### Target State
- All type errors block deployment
- All lint errors block deployment
- Zero `any` types in critical paths
- Strict TypeScript enforcement

### Scope Contract
**IN SCOPE:**
- Remove `ignoreBuildErrors: true` from `next.config.ts`
- Remove `ignoreDuringBuilds: true` from `next.config.ts`
- Fix all TypeScript errors revealed by strict build
- Fix all ESLint errors revealed by strict build
- Fix `sanity/lib/client.ts:22` - `urlFor(source: any)` → proper typing
- Fix `app/components/ui/buttons/CTA.tsx` - 7 type issues
- Fix `app/components/layout/catalogue/getCatalogueData.ts` - 5 type issues

**OUT OF SCOPE:**
- Type definition changes in external libraries
- Refactoring to improve types (only fixing errors)

### Definition of Done
**LAYER 1 - CODE COMPLETE:**
- [ ] `ignoreBuildErrors` removed
- [ ] `ignoreDuringBuilds` removed
- [ ] `npm run build` passes with zero TypeScript errors
- [ ] `npm run lint-strict` passes with zero ESLint errors
- [ ] No `any` types in API routes or checkout flow

**LAYER 2 - TESTING COMPLETE:**
