## SPRINT EXECUTION SEQUENCE

### WEEK 1: CRITICAL PATH (Scopes 1, 2, 3)
**Goal:** Unblock production deployment

| Day | Focus | Deliverable |
|-----|-------|-------------|
| 1-2 | Scope 3: Type Safety | Build passes with strict types |
| 3-4 | Scope 2: VFS | Frontend consuming VFS correctly |
| 5 | Scope 1: Stripe (Part 1) | Webhook handler functional |
| Weekend | Integration | End-to-end checkout test |

**Week 1 Exit Criteria:**
- [ ] `npm run build` passes
- [ ] VFS queries working
- [ ] Stripe webhook creates orders

### WEEK 2: PAYMENT & MONITORING (Scopes 1 completion, 4)
**Goal:** Complete checkout flow, add monitoring

| Day | Focus | Deliverable |
|-----|-------|-------------|
| 1-2 | Scope 1: Stripe (Part 2) | Stock reservation system |
| 3 | Scope 1: Testing | Checkout tests passing |
| 4-5 | Scope 4: Monitoring | Sentry integrated |

**Week 2 Exit Criteria:**
- [ ] Complete checkout flow works end-to-end
- [ ] Stock reservation prevents race conditions
- [ ] Errors reported to Sentry

### WEEK 3: TESTING & SCHEMA (Scopes 5, 6)
**Goal:** Reliable test suite, hardened schema

| Day | Focus | Deliverable |
|-----|-------|-------------|
| 1-2 | Scope 5: Testing Infrastructure | CI/CD with tests |
| 3-4 | Scope 6: Schema Hardening | Schema improvements complete |
| 5 | Integration | All tests passing |

**Week 3 Exit Criteria:**
- [ ] 27/27 homepage tests passing
- [ ] Checkout tests in CI
- [ ] Schema changes deployed

### WEEK 4: SECURITY & DEVOPS (Scopes 7, 8)
**Goal:** Production-ready security and deployment

| Day | Focus | Deliverable |
|-----|-------|-------------|
| 1-2 | Scope 7: Security | Rate limiting, CSRF, validation |
| 3-4 | Scope 8: DevOps | Full CI/CD pipeline |
| 5 | Buffer/Remediation | Fix any failing items |

**Week 4 Exit Criteria:**
- [ ] Security headers verified
- [ ] Rate limiting tested
- [ ] Full CI/CD operational

