## DEFINITION OF SPRINT SUCCESS

**ALL of the following must be true:**

1. [ ] **All P0 scopes complete** (Scopes 1, 2, 3) with ALL DoD layers verified
2. [ ] **All P1 scopes complete** (Scopes 4, 5, 6) with ALL DoD layers verified
3. [ ] **All P2 scopes complete** (Scopes 7, 8) with ALL DoD layers verified
4. [ ] **Regression test suite: 27/27 tests passing**
5. [ ] **Lighthouse Performance score ≥ 90** (homepage)
6. [ ] **Zero TODOs** in checkout-related files
7. [ ] **Build passes** with strict type checking and linting
8. [ ] **CI/CD pipeline operational** with automated tests
9. [ ] **Security headers verified** and rate limiting tested
10. [ ] **End-to-end checkout flow** tested and working in production

**Sprint is NOT complete until ALL 10 items are checked.**

